Whimsun had quite a few changes. Starting out with 1/3, it was buffed to 2/3 in '''Alpha 2.7'''.

[[File:Four.8 Whimsun.png|thumb|233x233px|Post Beta 4.8]]
This made it possible to make Whimsun a maximum of 5/3 for only 3G. Because of this, '''Beta 4.8''' nerfed it with -1/+1, making it 1/4, with a maximum of 4/4.

'''Beta 6.5''' buffed its ATK back up to 2, though, while keeping its HP at 4.

Stats:

ATK:
* 1 (Pre Alpha 2.7)
* 2 (Post Alpha 2.7)
* 1 (Post Beta 4.8)
* 2 (Post Beta 6.5, Current)
HP:
* 3 (Pre Beta 4.8)
* 4 (Post Beta 4.8, Current)
Cost: 3

Ability: Battlecry/Enter/Magic: Gain +1 ATK for each ally monster.

Rarity: White (Common)
